OL,3,AHenry Nowak killer applies to appeal
OL,4,Aagainst conviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC understands Digwa wants to
OL,7,Fargue that his conviction for murder is
OL,8,Funsafe on four grounds. The
OL,9,Fapplications do not mean Digwa will
OL,10,Fautomatically get any further hearings
OL,11,For reviews.
